<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>VerityBrand — Brand Governance</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

:root {
  --bg: #f7f5f0;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --ink: #171717;
  --muted: #77746f;
  --purple: #7651c8;
  --purple-light: #eee8fa;
  --border: #e8e4dc;
  --green: #287b57;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scroll-padding-top: 90px;
}

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

button {
  font: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.container {
  width: min(1160px, 90%);
  margin: auto;
}

/* NAVIGATION */

nav {
  height: 78px;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(247,245,240,.94);
  backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.nav-inner {
  height: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.logo {
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -1.3px;
}

.logo .verity {
  color: var(--purple);
}

.logo .brand {
  color: #171717;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 30px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #5e5a55;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
  color: var(--purple);
}

.nav-cta {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: white;
  padding: 12px 19px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 13px;
  border: 0;
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
  min-height: 660px;
  padding: 100px 0 80px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
  gap: 70px;
  align-items: center;
}

.eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  color: var(--purple);
  background: var(--purple-light);
  padding: 8px 13px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.dot {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--purple);
}

h1, h2, h3 {
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: -1.8px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(45px, 6vw, 76px);
  line-height: 1.06;
  margin: 27px 0;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.hero h1 span {
  color: var(--purple);
}

.hero-description {
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 490px;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.hero-buttons {
  display: flex;
  gap: 13px;
  margin-top: 32px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--purple);
  color: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--purple);
  padding: 15px 23px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: .25s;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  background: #6040ae;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink);
  border: 1px solid #d8d3ca;
  padding: 15px 23px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.hero-note {
  color: #96918a;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}

/* HERO DASHBOARD */

.dashboard {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #e7e2da;
  border-radius: 22px;
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(35,25,50,.08);
  transform: rotate(1deg);
}

.dashboard-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding-bottom: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeae4;
}

.dashboard-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.status {
  color: var(--green);
  background: #e9f5ed;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.score {
  margin: 24px 0;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.score-number {
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 48px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
}

.score-number small {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #a09b94;
  letter-spacing: 0;
}

.score-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.progress {
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #eee9e2;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.progress-fill {
  width: 86%;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--purple);
  border-radius: 10px;
}

.audit-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 15px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ede8;
}

.audit-icon {
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background: #f4f0fb;
  color: var(--purple);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.audit-text {
  flex: 1;
}

.audit-text strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.audit-text small {
  color: #99938c;
  font-size: 10px;
}

.audit-count {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--purple);
}

.dashboard-bottom {
  margin-top: 20px;
  padding: 14px;
  background: #f8f6f2;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #77716a;
}

/* GENERAL SECTIONS */

section {
  padding: 110px 0;
}

.section-heading {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin-bottom: 55px;
}

.section-label {
  color: var(--purple);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1.6px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.section-heading h2 {
  font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 55px);
  line-height: 1.12;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.section-heading p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

/* HOW IT WORKS */

.how-section {
  background: #fff;
}

.steps {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.step-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: #fbfaf8;
  transition: .3s;
}

.step-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
  border-color: #c9b7ed;
}

.step-number {
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--purple);
  font-weight: 800;
}

.step-card h3 {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin: 28px 0 13px;
  letter-spacing: -.7px;
}

.step-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: var(--muted);
}

/* REVIEW SECTION */

.review-section {
  background: var(--bg);
}

.review-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
  gap: 60px;
  align-items: start;
}

.review-copy h2 {
  font-size: 46px;
  line-height: 1.12;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.review-copy p {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.review-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 13px;
}

.review-row {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 20px;
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.review-badge {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border-radius: 11px;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.badge-red {
  color: #b54c4c;
  background: #fbeaea;
}

.badge-yellow {
  color: #a77a22;
  background: #fbf3df;
}

.badge-green {
  color: #287b57;
  background: #e6f3eb;
}

.review-row h3 {
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: -.3px;
  margin-bottom: 7px;
}

.review-row p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.review-row .fix {
  color: var(--purple);
  margin-top: 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* GUIDELINES */

.guidelines-section {
  background: #171717;
  color: white;
}

.guidelines-section .section-heading p {
  color: #aaa6a0;
}

.guidelines-section .section-label {
  color: #b6a0ed;
}

.guideline-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
}

.guideline-card {
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: #232323;
  border: 1px solid #333;
}

.guideline-card h3 {
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  letter-spacing: -.5px;
}

.guideline-card p {
  color: #aaa6a0;
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.guideline-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 20px;
  color: #c5b4f0;
  background: #342b46;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* WORKFLOW */

.workflow-section {
  background: white;
}

.workflow-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 14px;
}

.workflow-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 23px;
}

.workflow-card .number {
  color: var(--purple);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.workflow-card h3 {
  font-size: 18px;
  margin: 22px 0 12px;
}

.workflow-card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

/* INSIGHTS */

.insights-section {
  background: var(--purple-light);
}

.insights-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}

.insight-card {
  background: white;
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 18px;
}

.insight-card h3 {
  font-size: 21px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.insight-card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.insight-stat {
  font-size: 40px;
  font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--purple);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  letter-spacing: -1px;
}

/* CTA */

.cta-section {
  padding: 100px 0;
  background: #f7f5f0;
}

.cta-box {
  background: var(--purple);
  color: white;
  border-radius: 25px;
  padding: 65px;
  text-align: center;
}

.cta-box h2 {
  font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 55px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.cta-box p {
  color: #e4daf8;
  max-width: 550px;
  margin: auto;
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.cta-box .btn-primary {
  background: white;
  color: var(--purple);
  border-color: white;
  margin-top: 28px;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer {
  padding: 35px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.footer-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
}

footer p {
  color: #8b867f;
  font-size: 12px;
}

/* SCROLL REVEAL */

.reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(35px);
  transition:
    opacity .8s ease,
    transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);
}

.reveal.visible {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.reveal-delay-1 {
  transition-delay: .12s;
}

.reveal-delay-2 {
  transition-delay: .24s;
}

.reveal-delay-3 {
  transition-delay: .36s;
}

/* SCROLL INDICATOR */

.scroll-indicator {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 22px;
  right: 25px;
  z-index: 90;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 10px 15px;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--muted);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
  transition: opacity .3s;
}

.scroll-indicator span {
  color: var(--purple);
  margin-left: 8px;
  font-size: 15px;
}

/* RESPONSIVE */

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .hero-grid,
  .review-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 45px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding-top: 70px;
  }

  .steps {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .workflow-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 58px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) {
    display: none;
  }

  .nav-links {
    gap: 0;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 46px;
  }

  section {
    padding: 75px 0;
  }

  .guideline-grid,
  .insights-grid,
  .workflow-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .cta-box {
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .dashboard {
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .scroll-indicator {
    bottom: 12px;
    right: 12px;
  }
}

/* ACCESSIBILITY */

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    transition-duration: .01ms !important;
    animation-duration: .01ms !important;
  }

  .reveal {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- NAVIGATION -->

<nav>
  <div class="container nav-inner">

    <a href="#home" class="logo">
      <span class="verity">Verity</span><span class="brand">Brand</span>
    </a>

    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#review">Review</a>
      <a href="#guidelines">Guidelines</a>
      <a href="#workflow">Workflow</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Get started ↗</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</nav>


<!-- HERO -->

<header class="hero" id="home">

  <div class="container hero-grid">

    <div class="hero-content reveal">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        Brand governance, reimagined
      </div>

      <h1>
        Your brand.<br>
        Every word.<br>
        <span>Always aligned.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-description">
        VerityBrand helps teams create confidently.
        Review content against your brand guidelines,
        catch inconsistencies, and keep every message
        true to who you are.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#review" class="btn-primary">
          Explore the platform →
        </a>

        <a href="#how" class="btn-secondary">
          How it works
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="hero-note">
        Built for creative teams, marketers, and brand leaders.
      </p>

    </div>


    <!-- DASHBOARD VISUAL -->

    <div class="dashboard reveal reveal-delay-2">

      <div class="dashboard-top">
        <span class="dashboard-title">Brand health overview</span>
        <span class="status">● On track</span>
      </div>

      <div class="score">

        <div>
          <div class="score-number">86<small>/100</small></div>
          <div class="score-label">Brand alignment score</div>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align:right">
          <span style="color:#287b57;font-size:13px;font-weight:700">
            +12.4%
          </span>
          <div class="score-label">This month</div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="progress">
        <div class="progress-fill"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="audit-item">
        <div class="audit-icon">✓</div>
        <div class="audit-text">
          <strong>Tone of voice</strong>
          <small>Consistent with brand personality</small>
        </div>
        <span class="audit-count">Passed</span>
      </div>

      <div class="audit-item">
        <div class="audit-icon">Aa</div>
        <div class="audit-text">
          <strong>Terminology</strong>
          <small>Approved language detected</small>
        </div>
        <span class="audit-count">Passed</span>
      </div>

      <div class="audit-item">
        <div class="audit-icon">!</div>
        <div class="audit-text">
          <strong>Claims & facts</strong>
          <small>One statement needs verification</small>
        </div>
        <span style="color:#b17d25;font-size:11px;font-weight:700">
          Review
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="audit-item">
        <div class="audit-icon">◈</div>
        <div class="audit-text">
          <strong>Visual identity</strong>
          <small>Logo and colors match guidelines</small>
        </div>
        <span class="audit-count">Passed</span>
      </div>

      <div class="dashboard-bottom">
        ✦ Your brand review is ready. Explore the findings below.
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</header>


<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->

<section class="how-section" id="how">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-heading reveal">

      <div class="section-label">How it works</div>

      <h2>
        From brand guidelines<br>
        to confident creation.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Bring your brand knowledge together in one place.
        VerityBrand helps your team understand the rules,
        review content, and make better decisions.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="steps">

      <article class="step-card reveal">

        <div class="step-number">01 / DEFINE</div>

        <h3>Build your brand foundation</h3>

        <p>
          Import your brand guidelines, approved terminology,
          product facts, visual assets, and messaging principles.
          Create a shared source of truth for your team.
        </p>

      </article>

      <article class="step-card reveal reveal-delay-1">

        <div class="step-number">02 / REVIEW</div>

        <h3>Understand every finding</h3>

        <p>
          Review written content, documents, and creative assets
          for tone, terminology, claims, visual consistency,
          and accessibility.
        </p>

      </article>

      <article class="step-card reveal reveal-delay-2">

        <div class="step-number">03 / IMPROVE</div>

        <h3>Make informed decisions</h3>

        <p>
          Explore explanations, source references, and suggested
          corrections. Keep your team's judgment at the center
          of every brand decision.
        </p>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- REVIEW -->

<section class="review-section" id="review">

  <div class="container review-grid">

    <div class="review-copy reveal">

      <div class="section-label">Intelligent brand review</div>

      <h2>
        Catch the details.<br>
        Keep the meaning.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Brand alignment is more than matching a color or
        checking a sentence. Understand why something needs
        attention and how to improve it without losing your
        original intent.
      </p>

      <a href="#guidelines" class="btn-primary"
         style="display:inline-block;margin-top:25px">
        Explore brand rules →
      </a>

    </div>


    <div class="review-list">

      <article class="review-row reveal">

        <div class="review-badge badge-red">!</div>

        <div>
          <h3>Unsupported product claim</h3>

          <p>
            “Our product is the most trusted solution in the
            industry.” No approved source was identified for
            this comparative statement.
          </p>

          <div class="fix">
            Suggested action: Verify the claim or revise it
            to a supported statement.
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="review-row reveal reveal-delay-1">

        <div class="review-badge badge-yellow">Aa</div>

        <div>
          <h3>Terminology inconsistency</h3>

          <p>
            The content uses “customer portal” while the
            approved terminology specifies “client workspace.”
          </p>

          <div class="fix">
            Suggested correction: Use “client workspace.”
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="review-row reveal reveal-delay-2">

        <div class="review-badge badge-green">✓</div>

        <div>
          <h3>Brand tone aligned</h3>

          <p>
            The message is clear, approachable, and consistent
            with the defined brand personality.
          </p>

          <div class="fix" style="color:#287b57">
            No action required.
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="review-row reveal reveal-delay-3">

        <div class="review-badge badge-yellow">◈</div>

        <div>
          <h3>Accessibility consideration</h3>

          <p>
            A visual element may have insufficient contrast
            against its background.
          </p>

          <div class="fix">
            Suggested action: Check contrast and readability.
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- GUIDELINES -->

<section class="guidelines-section" id="guidelines">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-heading reveal">

      <div class="sect
